21-- **On the owner's Mac: unit tests and bounded tiny checks only.** A "tiny check" means a tiny model, ≤ 2 environments, ≤ 2 updates, < 1 GB RAM and < 2 min. Anything larger runs on the pod.
22-- **Pod:** 2- and 4-rank RTX PRO 6000 are authorized for verification. Before each run: read live price and state, check the pod isn't running someone else's learner, and write a run statement. Only Claude operates the pod.
