- `uv run mypy python/owl scripts`: **success, 57 source files** (`mypy.log`).
- After restoring mutations, `uvx --offline --from rust-just just py-prepare`:
  **passes**, including format/lint/syntax/mypy and **1,324 passed, 4 skipped**,
